# std/llm-call's image (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): build this directory as a
# Rust project with rustc. `--src:@=.` hands rustc the tool (Cargo.toml + src/;
# rustc skips the caos metadata — .caos-expr, DEPS, DEEP-DEPS/); `--dep0:@=…`
# hands it the llm-client code crate, spliced at `llm-client/`. Deps are named by
# LOCAL deep-deps mounts (declared in DEPS), never ambient /std. No runner is
# named: rustc DEPENDS on the pool and curries the built binary onto it itself.
run DEEP-DEPS/rustc -- --src:@=. --dep0:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-client
